      <h3>IM8 Brand Events</h3>
      <p>Supporting end-to-end delivery of IM8 brand events in Hong Kong: venue, vendors, scheduling, materials and on-site execution. I gather feedback from participants and the local community, capture event content for social recaps, and report on attendance and engagement.</p>
