      <p class="meta">B2B · Brand · Sourcing · Teleshop (HK), Jun to Aug 2026</p>
      <h3>KamePet</h3>
      <p>A brand-new B2B pet supply label I created as Marketing & Brand Development intern: naming, identity, website and video content, built to win retailers and importers. I sourced the range by scanning demand channels and running supplier outreach on Alibaba and Made-in-China, with RFQs in English and 中文.</p>
      <div class="nums">
        <div class="hero-num"><b>0 → 1</b><span>brand built from scratch</span></div>
        <div><b>50</b><span>partners onboarding</span></div>
        <div><b>20</b><span>short-form video concepts</span></div>
        <div><b>26</b><span>suppliers contacted</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="case">
    <div class="media"><span>AI benchmark visual coming soon</span></div>
    <div>
      <p class="meta">AI · Research · Cost</p>
      <h3>AI Video Benchmark</h3>
      <p>Five video models, one identical prompt and product image, judged on output quality and the real cost of a usable product GIF. I picked Seedance 2.0 Mini at HK$3–5.5 per GIF over MiniMax H3 at HK$6–14.</p>
      <div class="nums">
        <div><b>5</b><span>models tested</span></div>
        <div><b>Seedance 2.0 Mini</b><span>the winner</span></div>
        <div class="hero-num"><b>~50%</b><span>cheaper per GIF</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="case">
    <div class="media"><img src="cuddle-croo.jpg" alt="Cuddle Croo social content" onerror="this.replaceWith(document.createTextNode('Cuddle Croo'))"></div>
