      <h3>Cuddle Croo</h3>
      <p>My first internship: a social-first rebrand across Instagram and TikTok. I read the analytics weekly to see what moved the needle, then doubled down on it.</p>
      <div class="nums">
        <div class="hero-num"><b>+4,708%</b><span>Instagram reach</span></div>
        <div><b>+612%</b><span>profile activity</span></div>
        <div><b>900+</b><span>TikTok followers</span></div>
        <div><b>4.9s vs 2.5s</b><span>avg watch time, organic vs paid</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="case">
    <div class="media"><img src="data-analytics-1.jpg" alt="Excel valuation model" onerror="this.replaceWith(document.createTextNode('Data & analytics'))"></div>
