      <h3>Data & Analytics</h3>
      <p>Excel models, SQL and Python, learned in class and used to turn results into decisions: RFM targeting, pricing and bundling models, positioning analysis, database design, survey research, and SEO for a 25+ page website.</p>
      <div class="nums">
